https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Loon/TikTok/TikTok.list, policy = 新国手动策略, tag = TikTok, enabled = true
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Loon/OpenAI/OpenAI.list, policy = 美国手动策略, tag = OpenAI, enabled = true
